{"version":1,"content":"<p>由阮兆祥（祥師兄）主持的資訊節目《香港系列之細間始終你好》，今晚（17日）播出新一集。</p><p>今集祥師兄先後走訪鰂魚涌一間滿載家鄉味的福建菜館、大角咀一間見證香港工業興衰的機器廠，以及錦田一間讓人忘卻繁囂的書屋。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T12:58:53.265855+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T12:00:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T05:17:47.783046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:57:34.964333+00:00","content_hash":"d23e2a8bf1bbeeffb1c830e5f82f643b4085218b00389cecfbe37c89322b9915","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}